76
00:06:35,743 --> 00:06:38,119
Yeah, come every single day!

77
00:06:38,119 --> 00:06:39,659
Hello!

78
00:06:40,343 --> 00:06:43,410
- Good morning, Miss.
- Good morning.

79
00:06:43,410 --> 00:06:47,431
Good morning, Miss.
I'm Kwon Tae Seong, Yul's dad.

80
00:06:47,431 --> 00:06:49,643
- It's nice to meet you.
- Oh, hello.

81
00:06:49,643 --> 00:06:52,343
