Oh, this is something Yul's mom
used to do for her every day.

86
00:07:02,976 --> 00:07:04,476
Let me show you.

87
00:07:04,476 --> 00:07:09,943
She goes, "My Yul, today, too,
with friends, get along well!"

88
00:07:09,943 --> 00:07:11,751
My Yul, today, too,

89
00:07:11,751 --> 00:07:13,863
- with friends, get along well!
- With friends, get along well!

90
00:07:13,863 --> 00:07:14,876
Say goodbye to your dad.

91
00:07:14,876 --> 00:07:17,476
- Bye-bye!
- Let's go inside, Yul. Be careful!

92
00:07:17,476 --> 00:07:18,843
Careful. Take it slow.

93
00:07:18,843 --> 00:07:20,676
Have a good day.

94
00:07:26,410 --> 00:07:30,110
So she had her husband's help.
That explains it.

95
00:07:30,110 --> 00:07:31,476
He's handsome.

96
00:07:31,476 --> 00:07:33,810
Yul's mom really has it all.

97
00:07:56,010 --> 00:07:59,943
Good morning! You're here again today.

98
00:08:04,776 --> 00:08:06,310
Good morning.

99
00:08:08,076 --> 00:08:10,410
