Mom, thanks for the meal.

199
00:13:26,176 --> 00:13:28,543
Okay, hurry along.

200
00:13:28,543 --> 00:13:29,639
<i>Some speculate that Kingfisher,</i>

201
00:13:29,639 --> 00:13:31,143
- <i>the infamous serial gun killer...</i>
