203
00:13:33,676 --> 00:13:35,576
Tae Seong is going to be busy again.

204
00:13:35,576 --> 00:13:38,843
<i>Kingfisher is the nickname
for a professional sniper killer</i>

205
00:13:38,843 --> 00:13:40,839
<i>who has killed 93 people to date,</i>

206
00:13:40,839 --> 00:13:43,243
<i>starting with the 2010 Semyung-dong shooting.</i>

207
00:13:43,243 --> 00:13:44,807
- <i>Despite committing serious crimes,</i>
- Kwon Tae Seong!

208
00:13:44,807 --> 00:13:45,807
<i>criminals just received light sentences</i>

209
00:13:45,807 --> 00:13:46,807
- <i>and were released.</i>
