220
00:14:15,743 --> 00:14:19,010
When just the name 'Kingfisher'
triples the viewership?

221
00:14:19,010 --> 00:14:21,031
Besides, you're the reporter
covering Kingfisher.

222
00:14:21,031 --> 00:14:23,243
Who else would you give it to?

223
00:14:23,243 --> 00:14:26,376
Come on, that was ages ago...

224
00:14:26,376 --> 00:14:27,743
