I'll really give it my all this time.

236
00:15:03,010 --> 00:15:06,876
So you keep fighting too, Chief.

237
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:08,876
I'll get going.

238
00:15:08,876 --> 00:15:10,110
Hey! Tae Seong!

239
00:15:10,110 --> 00:15:11,776
